# Local-only handover notes. restart.md lives in the PARENT folder, outside both
# repos, because it references the other brand and this repo must stay free of
# any cross-reference. This rule is insurance: if a copy ever lands in here, it
# does not get committed.
restart.md
HANDOVER.md
*.local.md
